<title>THAILAND: Tipco Asphalt in $300 mln asphalt deal.</title>
<headline>Tipco Asphalt in $300 mln asphalt deal.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai asphalt distributor Tipco Asphalt said on Friday it had signed a 10-year contract worth $300 million to buy asphalt from local firm Thai Lube Base Plc.</p>
<p>Under the contract, Thai Lube would supply 300,000 tonnes of asphalt per year to Tipco, it said in a filing to the Stock Exchange of Thailand.</p>
<p>The first delivery would be made in the middle of this year, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
